<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>HoopDreams — Support</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --ink: #1c2333;
    --muted: #5a6478;
    --accent: #e8791f;
    --accent-dark: #b85f14;
    --line: #e3e6ec;
    --bg: #fbfbfd;
    --card: #ffffff;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .wrap {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 56px 24px 96px;
  }
  header {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line);
  }
  header .badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent-dark);
    background: rgba(232, 121, 31, 0.1);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 32px;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; }
  h2 {
    font-size: 22px;
    margin: 44px 0 16px;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 17px;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
  }
  p, li { font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink); }
  ul, ol { padding-left: 22px; }
  li { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  a { color: var(--accent-dark); }

  .faq {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 18px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .faq p { margin: 6px 0 0; color: var(--muted); }

  .contact-card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 2px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 22px 24px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .contact-card a {
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .contact-card p { color: var(--muted); margin-top: 6px; }

  .placeholder {
    background: #fde8e8;
    color: #a12626;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
    font-size: 0.92em;
  }
  .note {
    background: #fff7ee;
    border: 1px solid #f3ddc0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #6b4a1f;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  footer {
    margin-top: 56px;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

  <header>
    <span class="badge">HoopDreams</span>
    <h1>Support</h1>
    <div class="meta">Questions, bug reports, and how-to — all in one place.</div>
  </header>

  <h2>How to Play</h2>
  <div class="faq">
    <h3>How do I aim and shoot?</h3>
    <p>Touch and hold anywhere on screen, then drag away from that spot like pulling back a slingshot — the ball launches in the opposite direction. Drag farther for more power (shown as a live percentage above the ball), and watch the dotted preview line to see roughly where the shot will go.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq">
    <h3>What do the stars mean?</h3>
    <p>Each level can earn 1–3 stars based on how many shots it took you to score. Fewer shots, more stars. Your best result for each level is always saved, even if a later attempt does worse.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq">
    <h3>What happens if I run out of shots?</h3>
    <p>You'll get the option to retry the level from the start, or head back to the level list. Nothing is lost — your best previous result for that level stays saved either way.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq">
    <h3>The ball looks stuck / isn't moving. What do I do?</h3>
    <p>If a shot comes to rest without scoring, a "Tap to Reset" button appears after a moment so you're never stuck waiting — tap it to reset that attempt immediately.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq">
    <h3>What's the "Full Arc" option while aiming?</h3>
    <p>By default the trajectory preview shows a shorter arc. Tapping "Full Arc" extends it for a clearer full-length preview — either by watching a short ad, or instantly if you have Full Arc credits from the Shop. It's entirely optional and never required to complete a level.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Purchases</h2>
  <div class="faq">
    <h3>How does the Full Trajectory Pack work?</h3>
    <p>It's a one-time purchase that adds 10 Full Arc credits to your account, letting you skip the ad and get the full trajectory preview instantly. You can buy it again any time you run low.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq">
    <h3>I purchased credits but they didn't show up.</h3>
    <p>This can occasionally happen if the app closes mid-purchase. Try reopening the app first — pending purchases are checked automatically on launch and should apply on their own. If credits still haven't appeared after that, contact support below with your Apple ID email and roughly when you made the purchase, and it'll get sorted out.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq">
    <h3>Does "Reset Progress" delete my purchased credits?</h3>
    <p>No. Resetting progress in Settings clears your level stars and unlocks for a fresh start, but any Full Arc credits you've purchased are kept separately and are not affected.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Troubleshooting</h2>
  <div class="faq">
    <h3>Ads aren't showing up.</h3>
    <p>Ads require an internet connection to load. If you're offline or have a weak connection, ad-related features (like the free Full Arc option) may be temporarily unavailable — everything else in the game works fine offline.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq">
    <h3>Does HoopDreams work on iPad?</h3>
    <p>Yes. On iPad's wider screen, the game displays at its full intended layout with black bars on the sides rather than stretching or cropping anything.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="faq">
    <h3>What devices/iOS versions are supported?</h3>
    <p>HoopDreams requires iOS 17 or later, and runs on iPhone and iPad.</p>
  </div>

  <h2>Still Need Help?</h2>
  <div class="contact-card">
    <a href="mailto:abcdefghi9nut@gmail.com">✉️ <span class="placeholder">[abcdefghi9nut@gmail.com]</span></a>
    <p>For bug reports, please include your device model and iOS version, and what you were doing when the issue happened — it makes tracking down the problem much faster.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="note">
    <strong>Before publishing:</strong> replace the placeholder email above (both the visible text and the <code>mailto:</code> link target) with a real support address you actually check.
  </div>

  <footer>
    HoopDreams Support
  </footer>

</div>
</body>
</html>
